#7501
Long Winding Path~
You stand at the bottom of a lonely hill outside of town.  The path before you
winds upward to a house upon a hill.  A house once owned by a wealthy
alchemist, now stands alone, ruined, and if you can believe from what you've
heard in the taverns, haunted.  As you peer upward a light seems to shine from
one of the windows and out toward the sea on which the house stands beside.  
You notice that the house is backed up against a sheer cliff that you hadn't
noticed till you saw the light in the window.  A fog has begun to drift in off
the sea making the path hard to make out.  You're not sure which way the trail
lead from here but you assume up is as good as anything.    
~
